{
  "_about": "QA D1360 / D1378 / D1391 / D1395: the shared as-needed fixture. 'asNeeded' and 'notAsNeeded' pin the FROZEN round-31 phrase list (MarDoseSchedule.AS_NEEDED_PHRASES) that V260 backfilled prescriptions.as_needed from (PrnAsNeededBackfillMigrationIT runs the migration's SQL on every case and holds it equal to the Java reader). Since round 32 an order is as-needed only when the prescriber TICKS it. On an order NOT ticked (FrequencyWording on the server, unTickedFrequencyVerdict in the portal, one rule, FrequencyWordingTest and as-needed-frequency.spec.ts hold both to this file): 'fixedSchedule' is accepted, 'conditional' is refused as reading 'as needed', 'unreadable' is refused as no readable schedule. 'fixedSchedule' holds every fixed-schedule set of the QA scripts (r32, r33), every wording of D1391, the portal's dropdown and the frequencies used in the repo's seeds and tests; 'conditional' and 'unreadable' hold every wording of D1360, D1378 and D1395. 'dropdown' is the portal's frequency dropdown: never refused.",
